# ==============================================================================
# PriceNest — Root Environment Variables Overview
# ==============================================================================
# PriceNest uses component-specific environment configuration files:
#
# 1. Backend: Refer to `backend/.env.example`
#    Copy to `backend/.env` for local FastAPI & SQLAlchemy runtime.
#
# 2. Frontend: Refer to `frontend/.env.example`
#    Copy to `frontend/.env.local` for Next.js runtime.
#
# 3. ML Pipeline: Configured via Python scripts / YAML / environment variables
#    when orchestrating experiments.
#
# DO NOT store real production credentials, database passwords, or secret keys
# in this file or any committed file.
